    apply: { situation: ['Leo and Emma turn everyone\'s suggestions into a dinner plan. Read their conversation.', 'レオとエマが、みんなの提案をまとめて夕食の予定を決めます。会話を読みましょう。'], roles: ['Leo', 'Emma'], dialogue: [['Leo', 'Pasta for dinner? I can make the sauce.'], ['Emma', 'Nao would prefer rice, but she said pasta is fine with vegetables.'], ['Leo', 'All right. Tomato pasta and a salad?'], ['Emma', 'That sounds good. How much pasta do we need for four?'], ['Leo', 'Let\'s use four hundred grams.'], ['Emma', 'How many tomatoes?'], ['Leo', 'Four. Could you chop them while I start the sauce?'], ['Emma', 'Sure. Nao can make the salad, and Claire can set the table.'], ['Leo', 'Great. One chef was not enough, apparently.'], ['Emma', 'Four chefs, one dinner. We can do this.']], questions: [['What meal do they choose?', 'Tomato pasta and salad.'], ['How much pasta and how many tomatoes?', '400 grams of pasta and four tomatoes.'], ['Who will make the salad?', 'Nao.']] },
